__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.env
.vscode/

#What each one does
#__pycache__/ → ignores Python's automatically generated cache folder
#*.pyc → ignores compiled Python cache files
#.venv/ and venv/ → ignores virtual environments
#.env → prevents environment files that may contain private information from being uploaded
#.vscode/ → ignores VS Code's project-specific settings